    </nav>
    <div class="docs-search" hidden>
      <label class="sr-only" for="docs-search-input">Search the library</label>
      <input type="text" inputmode="search" id="docs-search-input" placeholder="Search the library" autocomplete="off" role="combobox" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="docs-search-results" aria-expanded="false">
      <kbd aria-hidden="true">/</kbd><div id="docs-search-results" class="docs-search-results" hidden></div>
    </div>
  </div></header>
  <main>
    <header class="reference-masthead">
      <p class="eyebrow">Reference library · 8 October 2026 snapshot</p>
      <h1>Definitions, contracts and sources</h1>
      <p>Inspect definitions, required record formats and permitted connections. Acceptance status and version labels are shown separately. Expanded essays and research are available below.</p>
    </header>
    {{LIBRARY}}
    <noscript><p>Browse the record sections below, or use your browser’s Find command. Interactive search requires JavaScript.</p></noscript>
  </main>
  <footer><span>CyberAlchemy Lab · Source snapshot: 8 October 2026</span><a href="governance-lab-reference.html#start">Return to the Lab overview →</a></footer>
